    {
      "name": "a_shape_that_did_not_run",
      "why": "A row present but carrying the did-not-run sentinel. Zero is not an obviously broken value in any of this report's columns, so the rendered cells must be marked rather than published: `0.0` ns/op reads as immeasurably fast and `0.00x` as a ratio of one.",
